    "answer": {
      "short": "$78.54\\text{ cm}^{2}$",
      "worked": "For each plate, $A=\\pi r^{2}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}A_{12}&=\\pi(12)^{2}\\\\A_{12}&=144\\pi\\text{ cm}^{2}\\\\A_{13}&=\\pi(13)^{2}\\\\A_{13}&=169\\pi\\text{ cm}^{2}\\\\A_{\\text{difference}}&=169\\pi-144\\pi\\\\A_{\\text{difference}}&=25\\pi\\text{ cm}^{2}\\\\A_{\\text{difference}}&\\approx78.54\\text{ cm}^{2}\\end{align*}$$\nRounded to two decimal places.",
